{"seq":3,"slug":"sandboxes-and-guardrails","title":"沙箱与护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-tooling-in-the-project/configuring-agents-for-the-project/sandboxes-and-guardrails","wordCount":1782,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"沙箱与护栏\">沙箱与护栏</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>权限回答「允许 agent 碰什么」,沙箱与护栏回答「它越线或犯错时,后果由什么兜住」。2025 年的一个实质性变化:Claude Code 把操作系统级沙箱直接内置进了 agent 循环。此前「放手让 agent 自动跑命令」几乎等价于免审批的全权委托;现在文档开宗明义——定义好命令能碰哪些文件、哪些域名之后,&quot;the operating system enforces that boundary for every Bash command and its child processes&quot;(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/sandboxing\">Sandboxing 文档</a>)。OS 边界接管了大部分逐条审批,自主性与安全性第一次不必互为代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>权限回答「允许 agent 碰什么」，沙箱与护栏回答「它越线或犯错时后果由什么兜住」——前者管授权，后者管<strong>失效</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>沙箱</strong>是进程级的隔离边界，分文件系统与网络两层：由操作系统原语（macOS Seatbelt / Linux bubblewrap + socat）对每条 Bash 命令及其子进程强制生效，因此不依赖模型自律。</li>\n<li><strong>护栏</strong>是模型之外的拦截层：deny 规则、ask 规则、<code>PreToolUse</code> hook（exit 2 硬阻断）、沙箱边界，四道机制各针对一种失效模式。</li>\n<li><strong>纵深防御</strong>把两者相乘：设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 层漏检率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，总逃逸概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∏</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，改善来自相乘而非相加——任何一层都无法替代他层。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选址公式收束全部设计：<strong>想给多大的自主权，先给多硬的壳</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"沙箱-隔离的工作环境\">沙箱:隔离的工作环境</h2><p><strong>机制:两层独立隔离。</strong> Claude Code 的 Bash 沙箱分文件系统与网络两层,可独立开关。macOS 上零安装,直接使用内置 Seatbelt 框架;Linux/WSL2 需要两个包:<code>bubblewrap</code> 负责文件系统隔离,<code>socat</code> 把网络流量中继到沙箱外的代理进程;原生 Windows 不受支持,须在 WSL2 内运行。网络侧默认不预允许任何域名:首次访问新域会提示确认,同域本会话内不再重复问;选「Yes, and don&#39;t ask again」则落成一条 <code>WebFetch(domain:...)</code> 允许规则存入本地设置,跨会话生效;开启 <code>strictAllowlist</code> 后,白名单之外的主机一律直接拒绝而非询问。入口是会话内的 <code>/sandbox</code> 命令:面板含 Mode、Overrides、Config 三个标签页(Linux 下另有 Dependencies 标签列出缺失依赖),其中 Overrides 对应 <code>allowUnsandboxedCommands</code> 设置——沙箱内失败的命令是否允许回落到非沙箱执行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{ &quot;sandbox&quot;: { &quot;enabled&quot;: true, &quot;network&quot;: { &quot;allowedDomains&quot;: [&quot;github.com&quot;, &quot;*.npmjs.org&quot;] } } }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sandbox\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"network\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"allowedDomains\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"github.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*.npmjs.org\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] } } }</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>强度谱系:按爆炸半径选隔离级别。</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>隔离对象</th>\n<th>网络控制</th>\n<th>重置成本</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>git worktree</td>\n<td>仅工作目录副本</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>并行任务互不踩脚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude Code 沙箱</td>\n<td>进程级 fs+net</td>\n<td>域名白名单</td>\n<td>即时(状态可弃)</td>\n<td>日常 agent 开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dev container</td>\n<td>容器</td>\n<td>可编排</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>依赖重的项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟机</td>\n<td>整机</td>\n<td>完全</td>\n<td>分钟级+镜像</td>\n<td>运行不可信代码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>worktree 解决的是并发冲突而非安全问题;真正的恶意代码执行应上移到容器或 VM。官方也建议按 dev containers、自定义容器、VM 的谱系做选型对比(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/sandboxing\">Sandboxing 文档</a>)。沙箱自身还提供硬门选项:托管部署可设 <code>sandbox.failIfUnavailable: true</code>,依赖缺失时直接失败而非降级为无沙箱运行——「沙箱必须在场」由此从愿望变成前置条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"护栏-自动的拦截\">护栏:自动的拦截</h2><p>护栏的要义是不依赖模型自觉。一次危险操作要穿过四道机制层,每一层都是模型之外的代码:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>deny 规则</strong>:<code>Read(./.env)</code> 类规则让泄密路径在工具层面不可达;</li>\n<li><strong>ask 规则</strong>:<code>Bash(git push *)</code> 强制人工确认,把人审聚焦到不可逆关口;</li>\n<li><strong>PreToolUse hooks</strong>:exit 2 硬阻断,stderr 反馈给模型(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks-guide\">Hooks 指南</a>);</li>\n<li><strong>沙箱边界</strong>:即便前三层放行,越界的文件写入与网络连接仍被 OS 拒绝。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;  OP[&quot;一次可疑操作&lt;br/&gt;例如向陌生域名外发数据&quot;] --&gt; R{&quot;permission 规则&quot;}&#10;  R --&gt;|&quot;放行&quot;| H{&quot;PreToolUse hook&quot;}&#10;  H --&gt;|&quot;放行&quot;| S{&quot;沙箱 fs/net 边界&quot;}&#10;  S --&gt;|&quot;边界内&quot;| RUN[&quot;执行&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt;|&quot;边界外且模式要求&quot;| U[&quot;人工确认&quot;]&#10;  U --&gt;|&quot;批准&quot;| RUN&#10;  R -.-&gt;|&quot;deny&quot;| BLK[&quot;拦截&quot;]&#10;  H -.-&gt;|&quot;exit 2&quot;| BLK&#10;  S -.-&gt;|&quot;越界&quot;| BLK\">flowchart TB\n  OP[\"一次可疑操作&lt;br/&gt;例如向陌生域名外发数据\"] --&gt; R{\"permission 规则\"}\n  R --&gt;|\"放行\"| H{\"PreToolUse hook\"}\n  H --&gt;|\"放行\"| S{\"沙箱 fs/net 边界\"}\n  S --&gt;|\"边界内\"| RUN[\"执行\"]\n  S --&gt;|\"边界外且模式要求\"| U[\"人工确认\"]\n  U --&gt;|\"批准\"| RUN\n  R -.-&gt;|\"deny\"| BLK[\"拦截\"]\n  H -.-&gt;|\"exit 2\"| BLK\n  S -.-&gt;|\"越界\"| BLK</pre><p>组合时有语义陷阱值得点名:启用沙箱后,裸 <code>Bash</code> ask 规则对沙箱内命令会被跳过(auto-allow),否则两套机制会在体验上自我抵消;但该跳过在 plan mode 不生效,且 v2.1.212 前后行为还有差异(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/sandboxing\">Sandboxing 文档</a>)。这个细节的教训是:<strong>护栏叠得越多,越要定期实测每一层真的在拦</strong>——连官方文档都得用版本号标注这类交互变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用沙箱和护栏让-agent-既能干又安全\">用沙箱和护栏让 agent 既能干又安全</h2><p>纵深防御的价值可以用一个粗糙但直观的模型表达:设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 层对某类危险操作的漏检率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,各层近似独立,则总逃逸概率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>escape</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{escape}} = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} f_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">escape</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若三层各把该类操作拦下九成(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i = 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>),组合逃逸率就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——改善来自相乘而非相加。这也解释了为什么权限、沙箱、hooks 要同时配置:它们针对的失效模式不同(授权错误、越界执行、时序窗口),任何一层都无法替代他层。arXiv:2506.08837 对这类架构给出了更形式化的论证:若干种对 prompt injection 具有 provable resistance 的设计模式,并逐一分析其效用与安全的权衡。</p>\n<p><strong>最大的自由以最硬的壳为前提。</strong> <code>bypassPermissions</code> 的官方警示是:它连保护路径的写入提示都跳过,只应在容器或 VM 这类「造成不了损害」的环境中使用(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/permissions\">Permissions 文档</a>)。这句话反过来读就是本篇的选址公式:想给多大的自主权,先给多硬的壳。组织侧也有对应的强制手段——用托管设置统一开启沙箱、设 <code>failIfUnavailable</code> 为硬门,并阻止开发者自行放宽策略;个人偏好再强也压不过这一层。反向的反模式同样致命:把 <code>allowUnsandboxedCommands</code>(沙箱失败回落非沙箱执行)当默认打开——回落通道一旦常态化,前面所有层的拦截率都要打上问号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><p>从零到一套可信边界的时间线:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>第一天</strong>:会话内运行 <code>/sandbox</code>,面板会列出当前平台缺哪些依赖(macOS 无缺,Linux 查 bubblewrap/socat/seccomp);</li>\n<li><strong>第一周</strong>:保持网络层默认全问,照常干活,周末把反复确认过的域名固化进 <code>allowedDomains</code>;</li>\n<li><strong>第一个月</strong>:做一次 fire drill——故意让 agent <code>curl</code> 内网地址、改受保护文件、向未授权域发请求,逐层验证拦截确实发生且有日志;</li>\n<li><strong>持续</strong>:凡需长期免审批运行的场景,先把宿主换成容器,再放宽模式——顺序不能反。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>沙箱把失败代价压缩进一个可抛弃的环境,护栏把危险操作从「概率事件」变成「结构性不可能」。两者叠加改变的不是某次结果,而是决策结构:逃逸概率足够低时,放手让 agent 自主工作就从冒险变成默认选项。壳有多硬,决定你能放多少权。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档:<a href=\"agent-permissions-and-safety\">Agent 的权限与安全</a> —— 纵深防御的前三层:deny/ask 规则与 PreToolUse hooks 的具体配置。\n相关文档:<a href=\"../an-agent-toolkit-for-the-repo/safe-by-default-tooling\">默认安全的工具</a> —— 「想给多大自主权,先给多硬的壳」在设计端的对应物:让默认方式就是安全方式。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"沙箱与护栏","id":"沙箱与护栏"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"沙箱:隔离的工作环境","id":"沙箱-隔离的工作环境"},{"level":2,"text":"护栏:自动的拦截","id":"护栏-自动的拦截"},{"level":2,"text":"用沙箱和护栏让 agent 既能干又安全","id":"用沙箱和护栏让-agent-既能干又安全"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Agent 的权限与安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-tooling-in-the-project/configuring-agents-for-the-project/agent-permissions-and-safety"},"next":{"title":"Agent 能跑的脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-tooling-in-the-project/an-agent-toolkit-for-the-repo/scripts-agents-can-run"}}